{
  "_why_this_recipe_exists": [
    "AmigaOS 3.2.2's own `HowToInstall` requires 'a successful installation of",
    "AmigaOS 3.2 or 3.2.1', so this is an update layered on top of the 3.2",
    "recipe rather than a second copy of it — `base` inherits the whole 3.2",
    "component list onto the `base` layer, and every component below is the",
    "update's own, on the `update-3.2.2` layer.",
    "",
    "Measured off the owner's own media with `xdftool list`",
    "(`E:\\amiga\\ProjeART\\layer-research\\census.json`), never retyped from",
    "memory — see `.superpowers/sdd/2026-09-04-layered-release/locale-rules.md`",
    "for the seventeen locale disks, which do not share one shape."
  ],
