    {
      "_why_required": [
        "Fix round 1, coordinator ruling. `Update3.2.2.adf:Install/Install`'s",
        "Classes step is `COPYDISKCONTENT classesPath` sitting in the main",
        "flow, no `askbool`, no condition — the release copies this disk every",
        "time, exactly like `Update3.2.2` itself. An optional component would",
        "let a user decline it and still get a tree stamped `Release 3.2.2`",
        "missing 31 files the release always places — the same shape as the",
        "`Devs/trackfile.device` defect, one level up."
      ],
      "id": "update-322-classes",
      "media": "Classes3.2.2",
      "layer": "update-3.2.2",
      "required": true,
      "label_key": "osinstall.components.name.os322.classes",
      "overrides": ["classes", "workbench-base"],
      "rules": [
        { "from": "Classes", "to": "Classes", "kind": "subtree" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_why_these_three_and_not_the_base_diskdoctors_three": [
        "Fix round 1, Finding 1. This component's rules were copied from the",
        "base AmigaOS 3.2 recipe's own `diskdoctor` instead of being measured —",
        "that component's `C/FixROMLibs` is right for *that* disk and wrong for",
        "this one. Measured off `Update3.2.2.adf:Install/Install` itself (the",
        "DiskDoctor block, design note ss2 / research note ss4 item 5): the",
        "installer copies `c/DAControl` and `c/DiskDoctor` into `C`, and",
        "`Devs/trackfile.device` into `Devs` — three files, never `FixROMLibs`.",
        "`recipe.rs`'s `update_322_diskdoctor_places_exactly_the_three_files_the_installer_does`",
        "is the test that reads this component's rules; there was none before."
      ],
      "id": "update-322-diskdoctor",
      "media": "DiskDoctor",
      "layer": "update-3.2.2",
      "label_key": "osinstall.components.name.os322.diskdoctor",
      "overrides": ["diskdoctor"],
      "rules": [
        { "from": "C/DAControl", "to": "C/DAControl", "kind": "file" },
        { "from": "C/DiskDoctor", "to": "C/DiskDoctor", "kind": "file" },
        { "from": "Devs/trackfile.device", "to": "Devs/trackfile.device", "kind": "file" }
      ]
